# Conformance probe pack for `twos` and `smag` under `bit_order msb-lsb`
# (spec 0.22, ruling 3: the sign is the last bit read). Public. No kinds. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the
# high bit of each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up.
#
#   byte 0        z      two's complement
#   byte 1        w      sign and magnitude
format     conformance-long-mlsb-signed
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.z  0:0:8  twos
field   probe.w  0:8:8  smag
